Part 1 - Dataset

1. Dataset Name: 
Loan Approval Prediction Dataset

2. Kaggle Source:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/architsharma01/loan-approval-prediction-dataset

3. Number of Rows:
4,269 rows

4. Number of Columns:
13 columns

5. Brief Description:
This dataset contains information about people applying for loans. It includes financial and personal information such as annual income, 
loan amount, loan term, credit score, education, employment status, number of dependents, and the value of different assets. It also shows
whether each person's loan was approved or rejected.

6. What I Want My Model to Predict:
I want to use Logistic Regression to predict whether a person's loan application will be approved or rejected based on their financial and
personal information.
